OL,3,GNEWSANI secretary arrives at Stormont
OL,4,Aahead of budget meetings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland secretary has
OL,7,Farrived at Stormont ahead of meetings
OL,8,Fwith executive parties about the budget
OL,9,Fdeadlock.
OL,11,FSir Chris Bryant, who has insisted
OL,12,Fthere is no more money available beyond
OL,13,Fthe #1.5bn the government has already
OL,14,Foffered, has accused executive
OL,15,Fministers of being financially
OL,16,F"irresponsible".
OL,18,FSir Chris held brief virtual
OL,19,Fdiscussions with parties last Friday,
OL,20,Fbut he is expected to meet leaders of
OL,21,Fthe four executive parties separately
OL,22,Fon Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
